bring flock/algebra/whole/hath_eke.tung
bring ilk/two.tung

## flipping, and `b -+ a`, which flippeth `b` and eketh `a`: `a` less `b`.
## each ilk supplieth `-+` directly, so wholetales and floats offdraw in one
## native step; `group_+` and `ring` soothe that it agreeth with flipping and `+`.
show flock hath_-: [α: *, *] {
  let -: [α, α]
  let -+: [α, α, α]
}

## `+` on `𝟚` is exclusive or, so each worth is its own flipping.
bizen: 𝟚 hath_- {
  let -: [a:] ≔ a
  let -+: [a:, b:] ≔ a + b
}
